#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Antares Launcher: pick an Ares scenario / Antares plugin and start the game with it.

Shows each plugin's solo chapters and how many you've unlocked (Antares keeps that in
registry/<identifier>.pn under its data folder: ~/.local/share/games/antares on Linux,
Documents\\Antares on Windows, ~/Library/Application Support/Antares on macOS). It saves a copy
of that progress to a file you choose, imports one, or resets it. Settings are kept in
~/.config/antares-launcher.json (%APPDATA%\\Antares Launcher on Windows, ~/Library/Application
Support/Antares Launcher on macOS). Lists the plugins in ../plugins unless another folder is
chosen.
"""
